flowchart LR
  Browser --> Apache[Apache + public/.htaccess]
  Apache --> Front[public/index.php]
  Front --> Router[routes/web.php + Router]
  Router --> Controllers
  Controllers --> Models
  Models --> PDO[Database::connection / PDO]
  PDO --> MySQL[(MySQL / MariaDB)]
  Controllers --> View[View + PHP templates]
  View --> Browser
  Browser --> Assets[CSS / JavaScript]
